---
---

<!-- Field Reports / Testimonials -->
<section id="testimonials" class="px-4 md:px-8 lg:px-16 py-20 border-b border-[#90c5ff14] relative overflow-hidden">
	<!-- Subtle dot pattern -->
	<div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.08]" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(168,85,247,0.5) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 24px 24px;"></div>

	<div class="relative z-10">
		<h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-sinistre mb-4 flex items-center gap-4">
			<span class="font-oldturcic text-2xl md:text-3xl text-purple-400/30 leading-none">𐰺𐰯</span>
			Field Reports
			<span class="flex-1 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-[#90c5ff14] to-transparent"></span>
		</h2>
		<p class="text-gray-500 mb-12 max-w-2xl font-mono text-sm">COLLABORATOR FEEDBACK // MISSION DEBRIEFS</p>

		<!-- Testimonials grid -->
		<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
			<!-- Report 1 -->
			<div class="group relative border border-purple-400/20 hover:border-purple-400/40 transition-all p-6 bg-[#0a0b0d]/50">
				<!-- Corner accent -->
				<div class="absolute -top-1 -right-1 w-6 h-6 border-t-2 border-r-2 border-purple-400/40"></div>
				<div class="absolute -bottom-1 -left-1 w-6 h-6 border-b-2 border-l-2 border-purple-400/40"></div>
				
				<!-- Quote icon -->
				<div class="mb-4">
					<svg class="w-8 h-8 text-purple-400/30" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
						<path d="M14.017 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151c-2.432.917-3.995 3.638-3.995 5.849h4v10h-9.983zm-14.017 0v-7.391c0-5.704 3.748-9.57 9-10.609l.996 2.151c-2.433.917-3.996 3.638-3.996 5.849h3.983v10h-9.983z"/>
					</svg>
				</div>

				<p class="text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
					"Ahmet's architectural decisions for our streaming platform were exceptional. His ability to balance performance with maintainability saved us months of technical debt."
				</p>

				<div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-purple-400/10">
					<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded bg-purple-400/20 flex items-center justify-center font-sinistre text-purple-300">DE</div>
					<div>
						<div class="font-sinistre text-purple-200 text-sm">Deniz Egece</div>
						<div class="font-mono text-xs text-gray-500">Founder & CEO</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Report 2 -->
			<div class="group relative border border-purple-400/20 hover:border-purple-400/40 transition-all p-6 bg-[#0a0b0d]/50">
				<div class="absolute -top-1 -right-1 w-6 h-6 border-t-2 border-r-2 border-purple-400/40"></div>
				<div class="absolute -bottom-1 -left-1 w-6 h-6 border-b-2 border-l-2 border-purple-400/40"></div>
				
				<div class="mb-4">
					<svg class="w-8 h-8 text-purple-400/30" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
						<path d="M14.017 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151c-2.432.917-3.995 3.638-3.995 5.849h4v10h-9.983zm-14.017 0v-7.391c0-5.704 3.748-9.57 9-10.609l.996 2.151c-2.433.917-3.996 3.638-3.996 5.849h3.983v10h-9.983z"/>
					</svg>
				</div>

				<p class="text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
					"Working with Ahmet on the education platform was a game-changer. His deep understanding of both frontend and backend technologies made complex features feel effortless."
				</p>

				<div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-purple-400/10">
					<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded bg-purple-400/20 flex items-center justify-center font-sinistre text-purple-300">TK</div>
					<div>
						<div class="font-sinistre text-purple-200 text-sm">Team Lead</div>
						<div class="font-mono text-xs text-gray-500">5-Person Dev Team</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<!-- Report 3 -->
			<div class="group relative border border-purple-400/20 hover:border-purple-400/40 transition-all p-6 bg-[#0a0b0d]/50">
				<div class="absolute -top-1 -right-1 w-6 h-6 border-t-2 border-r-2 border-purple-400/40"></div>
				<div class="absolute -bottom-1 -left-1 w-6 h-6 border-b-2 border-l-2 border-purple-400/40"></div>
				
				<div class="mb-4">
					<svg class="w-8 h-8 text-purple-400/30" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
						<path d="M14.017 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151c-2.432.917-3.995 3.638-3.995 5.849h4v10h-9.983zm-14.017 0v-7.391c0-5.704 3.748-9.57 9-10.609l.996 2.151c-2.433.917-3.996 3.638-3.996 5.849h3.983v10h-9.983z"/>
					</svg>
				</div>

				<p class="text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
					"His Rust implementation of our key-value store concept demonstrated exceptional systems programming skills. Code quality and documentation were production-ready from day one."
				</p>

				<div class="flex items-center gap-3 pt-4 border-t border-purple-400/10">
					<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded bg-purple-400/20 flex items-center justify-center font-sinistre text-purple-300">OC</div>
					<div>
						<div class="font-sinistre text-purple-200 text-sm">Open Source</div>
						<div class="font-mono text-xs text-gray-500">Community Member</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

		<!-- Stats bar -->
		<div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 border-t border-purple-400/20 pt-8">
			<div class="text-center">
				<div class="font-sinistre text-3xl text-purple-300 mb-1">3+</div>
				<div class="font-mono text-xs text-gray-500">YEARS EXP</div>
			</div>
			<div class="text-center border-x border-purple-400/20">
				<div class="font-sinistre text-3xl text-purple-300 mb-1">17K+</div>
				<div class="font-mono text-xs text-gray-500">USERS SERVED</div>
			</div>
			<div class="text-center">
				<div class="font-sinistre text-3xl text-purple-300 mb-1">5</div>
				<div class="font-mono text-xs text-gray-500">PLATFORMS</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
